  "details": "I think it would be nice to add a feature where; if you are in a world with a buddy of yours, you get the option to teleport to them and vice versa.\n\nThis is mainly for larger worlds. There are times when you join on a friend but you cant find them because the world is enormous and you cant message them to ask them if they can respawn and show you the way to their location.\n\nObviously there should also be some options for users (or even the new status menu) to tell vrchat whether or not you want to accept teleport request, or make it so you have to manually accept them or just plain ignore all of em.",
